      "sources": [
        "55 hpf: one follicle (Alt et al. 2006 Dev Dyn 235:1872-1883, PMID 16680726); its 35 um diameter is an estimate; 120 hpf: four to six 30 um follicles in a 150 um row; 264 hpf: 40 um follicles over 250 um (Trubiroha et al. 2018; research 03d rows; estimate)",
        "adult: several dozen loose follicles along the ventral aorta, drawn as 12 follicles of 120 um over 2.4 mm at 25 mm SL, scaled by SL (research 03d row; estimate)",
        "a chain of ellipsoids along the ventral aorta from u 0.15 caudally, v -0.66 to -0.7; the first follicle stays the most anterior one (Alt et al. 2006 Dev Dyn 235:1872-1883, PMID 16680726)"
